    "metadata": {
      "title": "Pre-existing stem cell heterogeneity dictates clonal responses to acquisition of cancer driver mutations",
      "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14261508",
      "publication_date": "2024-12-02",
      "description": "<p>This repository contains files for the manuscript entitled:</p>\n<p>\"Pre-existing stem cell heterogeneity dictates clonal responses to acquisition of cancer driver mutations\"</p>\n<p>There is 1 tarball with all files and pipelines for analysis of Fig 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, and there is separate zip folder with all files for analysis of Fig 3.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We also include sequencing results of new LARRY version 2 libraries (2 PCR replicates each). Barcode sequences are not collapsed by Hamming distance, but they are collapsed by unique sequences, and counted.</p>",
